  "description": "Dian is a writer who struggles to make a living. One day, a famous singer, Eda, shows up and asks for the return of the blue leather described in Dian's novel. Dian, a fan of Eda, tries to return the leather she returned when she rejected his proposal, but hears that her fiance has already left on a journey with the leather and the pain of heartbreak. \n\nWhen they are about to part ways, her aunt, who is urging her to get married, comes and suffocates Dian... Dian sees Eda's hand reaching out to her like a sip of oxygen, and she takes her hand to go on a journey together to find the leather. \n\nDian, who wants to succeed as a writer despite being a woman, and Eda, who is obsessed with leather and the sea. As the nights they spend together grow longer, the two begin to fall in love with each other's stories and eyes... \n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)",
